OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had three livers, now I'm
OL,4,Arunning a marathon'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Herefordshire man who received three
OL,7,Fliver transplants, including one
OL,8,Fdonated by his father, is training to
OL,9,Frun the London Marathon as he campaigns
OL,10,Ffor greater awareness of organ
OL,11,Fdonation.
OL,13,FCharlie Tobey, 25, from Woolhope, had
OL,14,Fhis first transplant at just two weeks
OL,15,Fold and later needed two more
OL,16,Foperations following complications as a
OL,17,Fteenager.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
